{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Return an `HrTime` instead of an ambiguous numeric `TimeInput`.** OpenTelemetry interprets a number below `otperformance.timeOrigin` as a relative `performance.now()` value. After a backward wall-clock adjustment makes this epoch-millisecond result precede the process origin, OpenTelemetry adds `timeOrigin` again, placing spans far in the future and breaking parent/child timing. Convert the computed value with `millisToHrTime` before passing it to span APIs.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74qHtx","finding_digest":"7cbd708ff7daf21b11c225bfdf7fb6685cc9b34861581cf0ea33789ad816737e","finding_id":"arf_v1_ps6xbd7x3lzbweocew75675wnb","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::livetimestamp::numeric-timeinput-origin-ambiguity","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::livetimestamp::numeric-timeinput-origin-ambiguity","line":401,"observation_digest":"b42c36164dc11974ab6dee3d41208f4483436109f343617320baf0afc2b7cfa4","observation_id":"aro_v1_wqwdmfsnyemxjk3n5y6uciepis","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ps6xbd7x3lzbweocew75675wnb","published_at":"2026-10-03T05:08:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tg7upsx4kf2zvkpnarndu2dogs","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"a165ff90cd897c7e14514e5effe44b49ab8a41b9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":399,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_5k6cnftlqbio7melz5rkdqnad7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T05:08:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
